    <cim:Names.name>SELRCC-VPS-PROD</cim:Names.name>
    <cim:IdentifiedObject.description>We are involved in the &#8220;Data Exchange for VP/S via ECP on PCN&#8221; project. To successfully register and operate our new ECP endpoints, we need a new V-Code for the production endpoint that will be used to access the VP/S.</cim:IdentifiedObject.description>
